# shadcn/ui (rudiment)

Interactive UI primitives come from **shadcn/ui** — not one-off styled `div`s for buttons, dialogs, forms, tables, sheets, or empty states. Shell chrome stays on **Tokens + HolonBoundary + NotionIcon**.

Official skill docs: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/skills  
Project skill: `.cursor/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md` (also `.agents/skills/shadcn/`)

## Do

- Before inventing a control, run / read the **shadcn** skill and use `npx shadcn@latest search` / `docs` / `add`
- Compose pages from registry components (FieldGroup forms, Dialog/Sheet, Tabs, Table, Empty, Sonner, etc.)
- Use semantic shadcn colors (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`) **inside** shadcn components
- Keep product shell themed via `Tokens` (`t`) — see `theme-tokens.mdc`
- Register every new meaningful region with `HolonBoundary` — see `surface-registry.mdc`
- Chrome / tree icons → NotionIcon registry; control icons inside shadcn → lucide (per icons rule + shadcn icons rule)

## Don't

- Hand-roll Button / Dialog / Select / form layouts when shadcn already has them
- Override shadcn component colors with raw hex or one-off Tailwind color utilities
- Skip `components.json` — the skill activates fully when that file exists (init under `apps/tally` when adopting shadcn)
- Replace Operator shell patterns (Board, Activity Bar, Console) with a generic shadcn Sidebar without an explicit product decision
- Drop HolonBoundary because a region uses shadcn primitives

## Paths

- Skill: `.cursor/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md`
- App: `apps/tally/`
- Tokens: `apps/tally/src/app/components/tokens.ts`
- HolonBoundary: `apps/tally/src/app/components/docs/HolonBoundary.tsx`

## Bootstrap (when not yet initialized)

If `apps/tally/components.json` is missing and the task needs shadcn primitives, **init shadcn in `apps/tally`** first (`npx shadcn@latest init`), then add components. Map CSS variables to brand purple (`#8B5CF6`) so shadcn and Tokens stay aligned.
